<title>USA: U.S.-SDR rate opener, weekly charge rates.</title>
<headline>U.S.-SDR rate opener, weekly charge rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said Monday's opening exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.44321, versus 1.44816 Wednesday.</p>
<p>The IMF said that for the week beginning December 2, the rate of interest and charges on the SDR, the rate of remuneration on members' creditor positions and the rate of charge on members' use of fund credit are all unavailable.</p>
</text>
